   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Y8WmpilFdKER"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Section 4A: Streaming Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Streams `jackyhate/text-to-image-2M` with simple custom aspect-ratio bucketing.\n",
    "This is **not** sd-scripts `BucketManager`; it is a minimal custom loop for proof-of-life training.\n",
    "With `batch_size=1`, each sample may use its own bucket resolution without padding.\n"
   ]
  },
