    "id": "1C5NyVXYA761"
   },
   "source": [
    "## Section 4: Phase A — Full-Rank Gemma Branch Warmup\n",
    "Train native Gemma `gemma_norm + to_k + to_v` full-rank before applying LoRA. Student forward is Gemma-only; CLIP is frozen teacher target. Text-delta loss makes the objective focus on CLIP's conditional-vs-unconditional contribution, not just generic denoising prior.\n"
   ]
  },
