     "text": [
      "Phase B skipped: gemma_clip_semantic_adapter uses semantic/timestep/long-token/SaRA gated cells, not dual-native LoRA continuation.\n",
      "Phase B complete. Next: validation grids, checkpoints, and reloaded-pruned final proof.\n"
     ]
